<title>TURKEY: Turkish Airlines to start flights to Sarajevo.</title>
<headline>Turkish Airlines to start flights to Sarajevo.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's national carrier Turkish Airlines said it will launch twice a week flights between Istanbul and Sarajevo with a stopover in Zagreb.</p>
<p>Turkish Airlines will fly to and from Sarajevo every Monday and Thursday with Boeing 737s from September 30, 1996. -- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 0875.</p>
</text>
